			description: [
				"&5Chargers are a type of bird creature that can be found in most every biome. But the TYPE of charger depends on which biome, and there are a lot of different ones!"
				""
				"&5They are pretty common to find all over, and are good to hunt for Charger Shanks (a decent meal when cooked), and feathers."
			]
