				"&5When the Void Walker attacks, it can cause blindness for a short time."
				""
				"&5The Void Walker drops Void Scales, useful for crafting."
				""
				"&5The Elkanyne is a passive creature that spawns in Savannah type biomes."
				""
				"&5You can lead Elkanyne around by holding Brown Mushrooms, as well as get them to breed."
				""
				"&5Elkanyne drop Ivory, which is good for crafting."
