		{
			title: "SMASH"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -1.875d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS FIGHT"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, while you've been working on getting the Ancient Teleporter up and running, I've been digging through the FOP Game Server a bit."
				""
				"&5Many of the higher up FOP corporate staff transferred their souls INTO the game. Each one has taken control of an Advent of Ascension boss."
				""
				"&dYou'll need to defeat each one, whether by combat or... other methods."
				""
				"&5Look at the matching quest for that."
				""
				"&dBut if you want to fight Smash, keep reading. Smash used to be one of the general managers, known as a big trickster. He was allowed to take over the 'weakest' AoA boss, and become King of the Trolls."
				""
				"&5You'll need to make a Troll Idol to get his attention. Then go to an open area away from your base and..."
				""
				"&dTHROW IT TO THE GROUND!"
			]
			dependencies: ["3E2831A2D27654C0"]
			size: 1.25d
			id: "3011291910FDA2DC"
			tasks: [
				{
					id: "154F2F7EF5DBE99B"
					type: "item"
					item: "aoa3:troll_idol"
				}
				{
					id: "68F860B8C1CA5409"
					type: "kill"
					entity: "aoa3:smash"
					value: 1L
				}
			]
			rewards: [{
				id: "08EBE5AEC1FC20E2"
				type: "choice"
				table_id: 5632731352558517809L
			}]
		}
		{
			title: "SMASH'S WALLET"
			x: 5.0d
			y: -0.625d
			shape: "diamond"
			subtitle: "BOSS BRIBE"
			description: [
				"&dWell, we take it you tried fighting Smash, or just wanted to see what this method was, right?"
				""
				"&5Either way, knowing there are other ways to fight the FOP is a good thing. Even though Smash is the weakest of the FOP Corporate, he's still a Boss level creature and can wreck you easily if you aren't prepared."
				""
				"&dSo we're going to try finding a way for you to 'pacify' each Boss if possible, and get them on your side. "
				""
				"&5Or at least get them neutral with you. Enough to get the Executive Card they carry."
				""
				"&dFor Smash, he really just wants some money. Not too hard, right?"
				""
				"&5I will note, though, even if you aren't going to fight the bosses, Bandit, each one gives you a sort of sample of the higher Tiers of worlds. Everthing get stronger as you progress."
			]
			dependencies: ["3E2831A2D27654C0"]
			size: 1.25d
			id: "72B31F94951E79EF"
			tasks: [
