		{
			title: "Smashed Out"
			x: 6.5d
			y: -1.25d
			shape: "pentagon"
			subtitle: "First Down, Twenty Eight to Go"
			description: [
				"&dOkay, good work Bandit. Handled Smash pretty well there."
				""
				"&5That's just a taste of the Corporate ladder in FOP. They only get bigger, badder, and harder to bribe from here."
				""
				"&dSmash was pretty low on the totem pole. But each Corporate Boss Card we get puts us closer to our goal."
				""
				"&5Boss Cards have special access to certain parts of the FOP Game Server. The more of these cards we get, the stronger a foothold we get into the system to go along with the Audubon Worm progress."
				""
				"&dEventually we can get a strong enough foothold that it'll be much harder for them to remove us when they discover us."
				""
				"&5When, not if, Bandit. They'll find us out eventually, its only a matter of time."
			]
			dependencies: [
				"3011291910FDA2DC"
				"72B31F94951E79EF"
			]
