			subtitle: "Fine fine, it's hell. Okay?"
			description: [
				"&dAlright, I think its time we head back to the Nether. We need to examine closer what the FOP has done with these other worlds."
				""
				"&5Be sure you are armed and armored, Bandit. The Nether is a much more dangerous place now. "
				""
				"&dI know we had you make the Lelyetia Realmstone, but hold off going there for a moment."
				""
				"&5Well, I mean we aren't going to stop you. Feel free to visit it if you want, but we'll need you to go to the Nether next when you are ready."
				""
