		{
			title: "Throw It Downtown!"
			x: 0.75d
			y: -5.0d
			shape: "rsquare"
			description: [
				"&dBandit, some of the NPCs the FOP have added wander the world, buying and selling certain goods for Scrypto."
				""
				"&5One you might like to keep an eye out for is the Assassin. He sells various weapons and ammo, doesn't have a huge supply but they are pretty cheap comparatively."
				""
				"&dThe Slice Star, Chakram, and Goo Ball can be Right Clicked and thrown as weapons. The Goo Ball slows enemies, the Chakram poisons enemies, and the Slice Star just... slices enemes."
				""
				"&5You can also find all of these in some loot chests, in Temple traps, or in certain Weapon Cases you can find."
