			shape: "rsquare"
			subtitle: "Or Gal, or Other, On Some Worlds!"
			description: [
				"&dIn most every world, Bandit, you can find a FOP NPC called a Lottoman. "
				""
				"&5The FOP added a random gambling NPC to encourage folks to try their luck and spend all their Scrypto."
				""
				"&dThey sell all kinds of random loot boxes. Kind of like our Blind Boxes, but way less stuff in them."
				""
				"&5The contents may or may not be worth the cost..."
				""
				"&dThe Weapon Case has...weapons. The Rune Box has runes. The Treasure Box could have money, gems, or possibly the rare Utopian armor piece."
				""
				"&5That armor increases your XP gain for Advent of Ascension skills. Good to find if you are lucky."
				""
				"&dOh yeah, the Lotto Totem? Epitome of gambling."
